## Development

```powershell
python tools/pico8_game.py validate {{GAME_SLUG}}
python tools/pico8_game.py run {{GAME_SLUG}}
python tools/pico8_game.py capture {{GAME_SLUG}} --state gameplay
python tools/pico8_game.py deploy-ssh {{GAME_SLUG}} --host onion@DEVICE-IP
```

Replace the starter goal game, then update this file with the actual rules,
controls, persistence schema, QA states, and device-test results.
